Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.80,0:00:47.81,Italics,Marie,0,0,0,,I will become the bride of the person \Nwho proposed to my older sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.83,0:02:23.74,Narration,Marie; narration,0,0,0,,Baron Shaderan has two daughters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.04,0:02:28.57,Narration,Marie; narration,0,0,0,,One is cheerful and sociable, \Nwith soft golden hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.57,0:02:31.75,Narration,Marie; narration,0,0,0,,Anastasia, the older sister, \Nis like a princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.53,0:02:34.93,Narration,Marie; narration,0,0,0,,The other is tall, like a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.33,0:02:39.09,Narration,Marie; narration,0,0,0,,All the tattered younger sister, \NMarie, does is read books.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.18,0:02:52.48,Episode Title,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(488,559)\pos(450,320)}Episode 1 {\c&HFFFFFF&}"I Could Never Replace My Sister"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.02,0:02:57.03,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,The Shaderan family is poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.20,0:03:04.45,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Every day there is a mountain \Nof housework to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.81,0:03:09.63,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,And meals for the family \Nmust be prepared as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.18,0:03:32.59,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Then there's Father's work, balancing the \Naccounts and signing documents in his stead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.74,0:03:39.02,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,But it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.51,0:03:41.71,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Tomorrow is my birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.15,0:03:45.73,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I'm certain it will be a good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.92,0:04:00.76,Default,Cedric,0,0,0,,Sister, you're amazing! You look beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.45,0:04:03.93,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Thank you, Cedric.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.46,0:04:06.41,Default,Cedric,0,0,0,,And your hair is so fluffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.94,0:04:08.31,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.99,0:04:11.91,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,Thank you for gathering here today!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.91,0:04:14.41,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,Here is the star of the day's events!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.41,0:04:14.74,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.92,0:04:18.72,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.72,0:04:23.15,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,This is a debut party for my sister to find \Nsomeone to marry among the great houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.61,0:04:26.38,Default,noble 1,0,0,0,,I am pleased to make your acquaintance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.38,0:04:28.20,Default,noble 2,0,0,0,,You are just as beautiful as they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.98,0:04:37.62,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Just because it's my birthday...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.62,0:04:40.25,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,it doesn't mean that I'd become \Nthe star of the evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.55,0:04:57.34,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Why was I born so horribly ugly?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.19,0:05:05.38,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Pardon me, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.21,0:05:08.07,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I apologize for startling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.07,0:05:10.89,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I've been invited to the birthday party.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.53,0:05:13.74,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,The entrance is through there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.74,0:05:16.46,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Thank you, Miss Maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.46,0:05:20.35,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Master, this personage is not a servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.35,0:05:21.46,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.46,0:05:24.78,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,The Shaderan family has one maid, \Na 60 year-old woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.78,0:05:26.60,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,They have no other servants.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.60,0:05:28.86,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Really? Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.86,0:05:31.55,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,She must be one of the two daughters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.55,0:05:34.26,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I have been terribly rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.26,0:05:36.69,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Please, forgive me, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.50,0:05:41.72,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.72,0:05:43.69,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Are you from the Ipsandros Republic?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.69,0:05:48.10,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Y-Yes. My mother was a traveling \Nperformer from Ipsandros.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.10,0:05:49.23,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,What of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.23,0:05:53.30,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Oh, I {\i1}knew{\i0} it! And your clothes are \Ntraditional Ipsandrian formal wear, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.08,0:05:57.34,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Are you knowledgable about \NIpsandrian culture?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.80,0:06:01.17,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I wouldn't say I'm knowledgable. I only \Nknow what I've learned from books.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.54,0:06:03.11,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,How unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.11,0:06:06.08,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,To think that you studied Ips culture \Nin a country as insular as this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.08,0:06:06.83,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Oh but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.21,0:06:10.38,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Once a person realizes the depth of \NIpsandrian technology and culture,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.38,0:06:12.37,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,they are instantly captivated by it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.37,0:06:14.38,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I am one such person myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.39,0:06:17.56,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.56,0:06:21.11,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,My personal wardrobe is made of Ips silk, of \Ncourse, but I insist that my underclothes are too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.11,0:06:22.61,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I won't compromise on that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.25,0:06:24.89,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,You are quite fashionable, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.21,0:06:28.85,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Personally, I love stories from Ipsandros.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.85,0:06:31.33,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Do you know the story, \N"The Raggedy Red Cat"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.33,0:06:32.49,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Yes, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.49,0:06:34.46,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Raggedy, the abandoned cat,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.46,0:06:38.09,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,travels with a kindly wanderer and \Ngrows stronger along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.58,0:06:40.95,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I have red hair and I'm \Nalways in tatters, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.16,0:06:44.51,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,A woman who makes a show of her \Nknowledge is an embarrassment!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.83,0:06:48.84,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I-I'm so terribly sorry! I've \Nbehaved in such a shameful manner!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.13,0:06:51.30,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Shameful? In what way?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.30,0:06:53.29,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,W-Well, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.77,0:06:54.96,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Please excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.96,0:06:55.59,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Please, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.63,0:07:00.14,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Eyes more beautiful than any star...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.51,0:07:03.34,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,How can he be so wonderful?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.10,0:07:09.97,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,And this wonderful man is here \Nto propose to my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.96,0:07:14.11,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Compared to her, I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.39,0:07:17.08,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,H-Have I offended you in some way?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.08,0:07:20.37,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,If it's because I mistook you for a servant, \NI'll apologize as many times as it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.37,0:07:22.30,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,You've done nothing wrong, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.34,0:07:26.18,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Your clothes...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.18,0:07:28.68,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Is there an extraordinary \Ncircumstance behind this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.18,0:07:34.25,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,No. I'm simply not lovely, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.60,0:07:40.34,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I have enjoyed speaking \Nwith you tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.68,0:07:44.23,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,You are beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.78,0:07:50.90,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,The evening's star is in the salon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.90,0:07:53.11,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Please go and enjoy yourself there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.57,0:08:04.59,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Those were the words I'd \Nalways longed to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.07,0:08:08.71,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,So why... why do I feel so sad?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.38,0:08:18.51,Letter Font,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(153,73)}To the eldest daughter of Baron Shaderan,\NLady Anastasia,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.38,0:08:18.51,Letter Font,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(153,245)}Beautiful lady, I would like to welcome you into the family of Count Granado as the wife of Kyros Granado. Even a day's delay is too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.68,0:08:15.13,Narration,Marie; narration,0,0,0,,One month after that terrible birthday,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.13,0:08:17.91,Narration,Marie; narration,0,0,0,,a letter with a marriage proposal arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.75,0:08:22.07,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,He's highly influential! \NYou'll be marrying upward!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.50,0:08:26.03,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,Count Granado will inherit \Nthe title of Duke one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.03,0:08:27.96,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,And he's exceedingly wealthy, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.96,0:08:30.95,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,You'll be able to live more lavishly \Nthan the monarch of a small country!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.95,0:08:32.91,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.19,0:08:35.99,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,Marie! Hurry up and pen a reply!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.99,0:08:38.42,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,Inform our relatives and \Nany neighboring nobility!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.55,0:08:42.00,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes, I will at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.34,0:08:46.91,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,I'm going to be married.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.91,0:08:48.92,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,And to someone whose face \NI don't even remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.46,0:08:55.08,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,I've heard that Count Granado is a \Nbad-tempered eccentric who hates women.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.08,0:08:59.78,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Please, don't worry. The proposal \Nletter was so passionate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.78,0:09:02.61,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I'm certain that he will cherish you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.83,0:09:09.27,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,But more importantly, there's \Nsomething I'd like for you to see!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.59,0:09:10.96,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Oh, how wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.96,0:09:13.84,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Marie, you're tall, so \Nit suits you perfectly!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.36,0:09:16.29,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Wh-What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.29,0:09:18.31,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Clothes made for a woman to dress as a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.31,0:09:20.46,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,I suppose this is what's meant \Nby "asking for the moon"!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.46,0:09:24.86,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,I love to see beautiful women dressed \Nas men and I love dashing ladies!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.86,0:09:26.70,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,I made all of this myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.70,0:09:28.32,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.32,0:09:30.93,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Please keep it a secret \Nfrom mother and father.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.93,0:09:33.92,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,They found some things before \Nand threw it all away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.78,0:09:38.94,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Sister, I didn't know you had \Nthese interests. How amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.94,0:09:43.20,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,If for some reason the Shaderan family \Ncould no longer sustain itself...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.20,0:09:45.92,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,If one day I had to work too...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.92,0:09:48.52,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,I thought that I might open \Na shop in the royal capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.67,0:09:51.13,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,Say, Marie...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.61,0:09:57.12,Default,Anastasia,0,0,0,,please make the most of your \Nskills and do work that you love.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.49,0:10:02.14,Narration,Marie; narration,0,0,0,,My older sister was beloved by everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.14,0:10:04.52,Narration,Marie; narration,0,0,0,,I loved her too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.56,0:10:13.01,Narration,Marie; narration,0,0,0,,But on her way to marry Count Granado...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.33,0:10:16.67,Narration,Marie; narration,0,0,0,,she lost her life in an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.03,0:10:23.43,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.94,0:10:26.55,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,A long time ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.07,0:10:30.68,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,she would often read \N"The Raggedy Red Cat" to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.67,0:10:43.86,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,You should have been the one to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.34,0:10:47.04,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,Why is it you and not she who is alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.04,0:10:49.11,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,You killed Anastasia, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.11,0:10:51.01,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,It's your fault! You murderer!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.01,0:10:53.22,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,You and that red hair of yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.18,0:10:57.75,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,Will you stop? You'll leave marks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.75,0:11:01.54,Default,Elvira,0,0,0,,She {\i1}should{\i0} be scarred! So scarred that \Nno one will ever look at her face again!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.54,0:11:02.36,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.36,0:11:07.02,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,Marie will take Anastasia's place and \Ngo to the home of Count Granado.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.46,0:11:10.17,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Me? Take my sister's place?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.17,0:11:11.96,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.96,0:11:14.51,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,I know that you are a hideous little thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.82,0:11:17.04,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Th-Then why...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.04,0:11:20.31,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,We've sold everything that was \Nsent to us for the betrothal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.31,0:11:22.36,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,We don't have the money to buy it all back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.07,0:11:27.73,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,The count will be heartbroken at the \Nloss of Anastasia. Exploit that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.73,0:11:32.01,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,Even if it's just one night of comfort, \Nonce you create a connection, we've won.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.74,0:11:34.80,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,A night of comfort?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.48,0:11:38.62,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,Be Anastasia's replacement, Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.62,0:11:40.71,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,That is how you can atone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.46,0:11:43.86,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Atone?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.08,0:11:49.18,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,What crime have I committed?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.92,0:11:53.19,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.78,0:11:58.85,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Being born as lowly me... that was my mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.64,0:12:06.83,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,Be docile and amenable, Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.83,0:12:07.71,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.71,0:12:11.41,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,If the count dissolves the betrothal, \Nreturn home immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.41,0:12:12.55,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.55,0:12:15.99,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,I'm saying these things for your sake, \Nfailure that you are. You understand that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.33,0:12:18.50,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.13,0:12:22.39,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,Not even your smile is lovable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.39,0:12:27.71,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,It would have been far better for you \Nto have died instead of Anastasia.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.37,0:12:33.89,Narration,Marie; narration,0,0,0,,Today, I go to the man who \Nproposed to my older sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.61,0:12:35.99,Narration,Marie; narration,0,0,0,,to be his bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.10,0:12:39.74,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,What is the meaning of this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.05,0:12:43.76,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,Let us into the palace! We \Nsent a letter in advance!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.76,0:12:46.02,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,Y-You say that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.02,0:12:48.42,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,The letter arrived only this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.26,0:12:53.08,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,To call that advance notice puts \Nus all in a difficult position.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.62,0:12:57.08,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,There is no point in speaking \Nto you! Bring the count here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.08,0:12:58.09,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,You're just a servant!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.09,0:12:59.00,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.72,0:13:07.27,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Baron Shaderan, I must ask that you leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.53,0:13:10.52,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,This woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.14,0:13:15.39,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I-I'm so sorry! My father \Nhas been terribly rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.39,0:13:17.69,Italics,Mio; Tomas; internal,0,0,0,,That bow of contrition was so fluid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.05,0:13:21.58,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I'm truly so very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.89,0:13:28.25,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Y-You're... No. Are you Lady Marie?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.25,0:13:31.93,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Y-Yes. I am Marie, daughter \Nof the House of Shaderan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.93,0:13:33.91,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Though I don't look anything \Nlike my older sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.32,0:13:39.30,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Tomas, take a message to \Nthe master immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.30,0:13:40.33,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.59,0:13:44.74,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.74,0:13:47.56,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I am the head chamberlain, Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.56,0:13:49.63,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Lady Marie, please come inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.61,0:13:53.72,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,You can't be serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.05,0:13:55.80,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Send Marie Shaderan away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.12,0:13:58.34,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,B-But, Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.34,0:14:02.07,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,The one I proposed to was Anastasia! \NNot her younger sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.20,0:14:07.03,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Oh, Anastasia. If only I'd \Nwhisked you away that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.03,0:14:07.82,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.82,0:14:08.91,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.91,0:14:11.03,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,If it's about Marie Shaderan, \NI've told you to—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.77,0:14:16.35,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,M-My name is Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.35,0:14:19.51,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,It is, um... It is an \Nhonor to meet you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.99,0:14:22.00,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,L-Lord Kyros?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.00,0:14:24.56,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Oh, how could this have happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.56,0:14:27.88,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I never imagined that Count Granado \Nwas the man I met that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.88,0:14:30.55,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,A pleasure to meet you, Count Granado.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.55,0:14:36.50,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,My eldest daughter Anastasia's unfortunate \Naccident brought our marriage talks to a halt,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.50,0:14:38.76,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,and your lordship must be heartbroken.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.76,0:14:44.30,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,And so I have brought Anastasia's \Nsister by blood, Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.30,0:14:47.41,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie? You're Marie?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.41,0:14:49.92,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,This is, indeed, Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.92,0:14:53.06,Default,Gregor,0,0,0,,She compares quite unfavorably \Nwith Anastasia, but—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.31,0:14:58.61,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Master, your expression has \Nbecome quite frightening.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.47,0:15:10.64,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,That was unseemly of me. Please spend the \Nnight in comfort here in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.22,0:15:15.35,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I shall prepare a room immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.24,0:15:22.13,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Um, where has my father gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.13,0:15:24.65,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,He is meeting with the master.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.65,0:15:27.02,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,In the meantime, why not \Nrelax with a cup of tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.52,0:15:31.21,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What a lovely aroma.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.21,0:15:34.60,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Could it be that this is from \Nthe Republic of Ipsandros?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.60,0:15:36.46,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,How impressive that you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.46,0:15:41.23,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I once read that they put spices in their tea \Nand drink it for their health in that country.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.62,0:15:43.61,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,It's ginger and cinnamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.61,0:15:45.63,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,They go well with tea from this country too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.87,0:15:53.39,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Ipsandros is truly amazing to be able \Nto create a tea as delicious as this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.72,0:15:57.60,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,H-Have I said something strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.60,0:16:01.31,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Pardon me. I was just thinking that \Nyou are quite adorable, Lady Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.63,0:16:04.16,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Adorable?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.08,0:16:06.50,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Yes, coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.10,0:16:11.07,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Count Kyros Granado!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.67,0:16:13.72,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I'm so terribly sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.15,0:16:15.16,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.50,0:16:18.35,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,W-We have been unforgivably discourteous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.35,0:16:20.29,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I-Is my father...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.58,0:16:21.79,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,He left.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.79,0:16:24.12,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I said, "There's no need to \Nreturn the betrothal gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.12,0:16:27.38,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Offer them to Miss Anastasia's \Ngrave for me," and he was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.66,0:16:28.44,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.16,0:16:30.36,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.36,0:16:32.01,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,There's something I want to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.01,0:16:33.55,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Wh-What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.83,0:16:37.23,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie, has your family been abusing you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.10,0:16:39.40,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Abusing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.26,0:16:44.22,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,It's true that they didn't \Ntreat me with much affection.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.22,0:16:46.72,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,But that's because they were \Ntraining me, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.92,0:16:50.57,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,It... wasn't that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.07,0:16:53.85,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,The reason that Father and \NMother are strict with me
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.85,0:16:56.34,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,is so that a know-nothing \Nlike me can survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.34,0:16:59.45,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I don't know how it may look \Nto you, your lordship, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.45,0:17:00.62,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,It's Kyros.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.61,0:17:03.27,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,My name is Kyros.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.63,0:17:06.32,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I don't like being called by \Nmy family name or my title.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.32,0:17:07.95,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I want you to call me by my first name.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.46,0:17:11.29,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Of course... Lord Kyros.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.72,0:17:13.59,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Going back to what you were saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.04,0:17:19.22,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,If you weren't being mistreated, then why \Nwere you dressed like that on your birthday?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.69,0:17:20.63,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,That's because...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.05,0:17:25.12,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Clothes like those are normally \Nworn by widows and nuns.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.12,0:17:27.23,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,It's a color meant to turn men away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.23,0:17:28.89,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Are you going to become a nun?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.22,0:17:30.06,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.06,0:17:32.44,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Then, do you simply hate men?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.44,0:17:33.35,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.35,0:17:36.99,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Then, did you act as a foil for \Nyour sister because you wanted to?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.93,0:17:39.96,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Are you unhappy in the Shaderan family?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.10,0:17:43.86,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie, I can't understand \Nanything if you don't speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.32,0:17:46.62,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,It wasn't a life I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.62,0:17:50.38,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,But I never entertained any \Nhope of escaping that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.81,0:17:53.27,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I hate this. This time here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.79,0:17:54.76,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.26,0:17:58.02,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,am not lovely, you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.51,0:18:01.77,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.21,0:18:04.27,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Mio, take Marie away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.27,0:18:06.28,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Yes, master.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.28,0:18:07.85,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I'm being cast out, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.85,0:18:11.31,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,It was strange that they let \Nme into the palace at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.31,0:18:12.36,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Lady Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.47,0:18:14.67,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.67,0:18:17.16,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I've already arranged for a \Nbath and a change of clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.48,0:18:19.90,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,What? What is she talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.21,0:18:35.89,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Wh-What is this? Could it \Nbe that {\i0}this{\i1} is the bath?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.89,0:18:38.09,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,How much firewood and water does this use?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.09,0:18:39.89,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Cleaning it must be difficult too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.16,0:18:43.91,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I see! They're telling me \Nto chop firewood and clean!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.91,0:18:46.38,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,That will wash away all the \Ndiscourteousness I've shown him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.38,0:18:48.16,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,What a magnanimous man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.16,0:18:50.35,Default,Tunika,0,0,0,,Oh, I've been waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.03,0:18:55.28,Default,Tunika,0,0,0,,I am Tunika. I am the keeper \Nof the baths for the count.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.55,0:18:57.76,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Lady Marie, she knows many bathing methods
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.76,0:19:00.37,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,and massages that are good \Nfor health and beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.37,0:19:03.49,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,She is also well-versed in medicines \Nand their effects. A true beauty pro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.82,0:19:05.00,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,A beauty pro?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.00,0:19:06.25,Default,Tunika,0,0,0,,A professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.35,0:19:10.78,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Wh-When did you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.21,0:19:16.07,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Lady Marie, if Tunika displeases you too \Ngreatly, please feel free to slap her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.07,0:19:17.37,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.37,0:19:19.83,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,But I'm going to be cleaning the baths now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.83,0:19:24.17,Default,Tunika,0,0,0,,Oh, no. It isn't the bath that will \Nbe beautified. It's you, Lady Marie!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.17,0:19:25.55,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.39,0:19:31.23,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,It smells so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.23,0:19:35.63,Default,Tunika,0,0,0,,I've added salt, honey, and citrus fruits.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.63,0:19:39.20,Default,Tunika,0,0,0,,I'll have you reborn, all \Nsoft and sparklingly clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.43,0:19:40.93,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Reborn?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.74,0:19:46.41,Default,Tunika,0,0,0,,A chrysalis is meant to turn \Ninto a butterfly, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.51,0:19:51.16,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Who will... turn into what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.12,0:20:41.75,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,What a beautiful person. Who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.75,0:20:42.68,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.84,0:20:52.07,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Liu Liu!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.47,0:20:53.73,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.75,0:20:56.57,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,I can hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.32,0:21:07.27,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,Kyros, you're more swayed by \Ngood looks than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.27,0:21:08.28,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Good looks?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.28,0:21:10.65,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Please do this properly, mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.65,0:21:13.84,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,The head of the family's approval is \Nnecessary for a betrothal between nobles,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.84,0:21:15.61,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,which means it rests \Nentirely with you, mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.86,0:21:16.96,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.96,0:21:20.63,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Lord Kyros mentioned that his mother \Nwas from Ipsandros, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.63,0:21:22.55,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,No good. She's lacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.55,0:21:23.98,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.55,0:21:27.36,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,She is overwhelmingly lacking in confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.36,0:21:32.32,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,The future wife of a duke must \Nstand proudly, noble and strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.32,0:21:34.15,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,At least, she must before \Nthe wedding day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.81,0:21:38.89,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,The real work starts now. \NI'll do what I can to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.89,0:21:40.61,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Thank you, mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.19,0:21:43.55,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Lady Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.55,0:21:44.90,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.90,0:21:47.63,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Wait. Congratulations? For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.63,0:21:51.46,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,The duchess has approved your \Nbetrothal to Lord Kyros.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.46,0:21:55.54,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Now, you are officially Count \NKyros Granado's fiancée.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.54,0:21:57.74,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,F-Fiancée?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.74,0:22:01.49,Default,servants,0,0,0,,Congratulations on your betrothal, \NLord Kyros, Lady Marie!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.90,0:22:04.40,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,So my son is finally getting married!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.40,0:22:06.43,Default,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,At last I can set down these burdens.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.43,0:22:08.71,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Liu Liu, it's far too soon for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.71,0:22:10.92,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,We haven't even held the \Nbetrothal ceremony yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.59,0:22:12.67,Default Top,Liu Liu,0,0,0,,That's true enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.67,0:22:16.44,Default Top,Kyros,0,0,0,,I know! Let's dispatch a messenger so that \Nwe can decide on a date for the ceremony!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.44,0:22:16.86,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Um, excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.19,0:22:19.86,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I... I can't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.90,0:22:25.85,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.59,0:24:00.23,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.23,0:24:03.00,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Why has the count proposed to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.17,0:24:10.50,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I may be my sister's replacement, but a \Ntattered mess like me could never be loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.05,0:24:16.77,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,My life here is like a dream. It's \Nsure to disappear at any moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.70,0:24:20.96,Default Top,Marie,0,0,0,,Next time, "Marie, I Want to Marry You."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.22,0:24:27.01,Episode Title,text; bottom right,0,0,0,,{\fad(488,1)\pos(472,320)\c&HFFE4E4&\4c&H724C4B&}Episode 2 " Marie, I Want to Marry You"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.51,0:24:24.03,Default Top,Marie,0,0,0,,P-Please come and watch.
